sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor K as Kunde
    participant LM as LoginModel
    participant RL as RateLimiter ("auth")
    participant RC as IRecaptchaVerifier
    participant LO as LoginLockoutTracker
    participant US as IUserAccountStore
    participant PL as IPendingLoginStore
    participant ES as IEmailSender
    participant TM as VerifyTotpModel
    participant CM as ConfirmLoginModel

    Note over K,CM: Two steps. A correct password alone never signs anyone in:<br/>the second step is either an emailed link or, if the account has 2FA, a TOTP code.

    K->>LM: POST /Account/Login (email, password, captcha token)
    LM->>RL: 50 requests per minute per IP?
    alt over the limit
        RL-->>K: 429 Too Many Requests
    else within the limit
        LM->>RC: VerifyAsync(captcha token)
        Note over RC: Google siteverify. Skipped when no SecretKey is set,<br/>fails closed if Google is unreachable.
        alt captcha rejected
            LM-->>K: "Bekraeft at du ikke er en robot"
        else captcha ok
            LM->>LO: IsLockedOut(email)
            alt locked out
                LO-->>LM: true
                LM-->>K: "Too many attempts" or, after 5 failures,<br/>"reset your password to unlock"
            else not locked
                LM->>US: FindByEmail(email)
                US-->>LM: ApplicationUser or null
                LM->>LM: PasswordHasher.VerifyHashedPassword

                alt wrong password, unknown email, or inactive account
                    LM->>LO: RegisterFailedAttempt(email)
                    Note over LO: Delay grows 3^n seconds (cap 5 min).<br/>3rd failure: notice emailed to the owner, in the<br/>owner's stored language (Users.PrefersEnglish).<br/>5th failure: locked until a password reset.
                    LM-->>K: "Forkert e-mail eller adgangskode"
                    Note over LM: One message for all three cases -<br/>no account enumeration.
                else password correct
                    LM->>LO: Clear(email)
                    LM->>LM: IsSafeLocalUrl(returnUrl)?
                    alt TotpEnabled
                        LM->>PL: Create(userId, safeReturnUrl, 5 min)
                        PL-->>LM: raw token (SHA-256 hash stored, never emailed)
                        LM-->>K: Redirect to /Account/VerifyTotp?token=...
                    else no 2FA
                        LM->>PL: Create(userId, safeReturnUrl, 15 min)
                        PL-->>LM: raw token (SHA-256 hash stored)
                        LM->>ES: SendAsync(confirmation link) - Danish or English,<br/>after the marsvin-lang cookie of this browser
                        LM-->>K: Redirect to /Account/CheckEmail
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    alt second step: TOTP code
        K->>TM: POST /Account/VerifyTotp (token, 6-digit code)
        TM->>PL: Peek(token)
        Note over PL: Peek does not spend the token, so a typo<br/>can be retried until it expires.
        TM->>LO: IsLockedOut(email)
        TM->>TM: Totp.ValidateCode(secret, code)<br/>HMAC-SHA1, 30 s step, plus or minus one step
        alt wrong code
            TM->>LO: RegisterFailedAttempt(email)
            TM-->>K: "Forkert kode"
        else code ok
            TM->>LO: Clear(email)
            TM->>PL: Consume(token)
            TM->>US: RecordActivity(userId)
            TM->>TM: merge the guest cart into the account's cart
            TM->>TM: SignInAsync - auth cookie with the account's security stamp<br/>HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, 30 min idle, 8 h max
            TM-->>K: LocalRedirect(returnUrl) or /Index
        end
    else second step: emailed link
        K->>CM: GET /Account/ConfirmLogin?token=...
        CM->>PL: Consume(token)
        Note over PL: Single use. Expired, already used<br/>or unknown all return null.
        alt token invalid
            PL-->>CM: null
            CM-->>K: "Log ind igen"
        else token valid
            PL-->>CM: ticket(userId, returnUrl)
            CM->>US: FindById(userId)
            alt account gone or deactivated meanwhile
                CM-->>K: "Log ind igen"
            else account active
                CM->>US: RecordActivity(userId)
                CM->>CM: merge the guest cart into the account's cart,<br/>claim a guest order just placed in this session<br/>(same session AND same email)
                CM->>CM: SignInAsync - auth cookie with the account's security stamp<br/>HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, 30 min idle, 8 h max
                CM-->>K: LocalRedirect(returnUrl) or /Index
            end
        end
    end

    Note over K,CM: The "check your email" tab polls /Account/Profile (check-email.js)<br/>and moves on by itself once another tab has confirmed the link.<br/>From here on, every request re-checks the account - see the session-check diagram.
